      "patient_response": "Hi Dr. Smith. I came in because, well, I can’t seem to stop launching projects lately. \n\nIt just gets to be... a lot. I'll start drafting massive work plans, mapping out all these new certification schedules, completely upgrading my home network... even sending out messages to old contacts I haven't talked to in years. It gets so intense that I just blow past normal limits. Honestly, I don't really slow down until my wife or my director at work has to step in and pull me back.",
